sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as 👤 Customer
    actor Employee as 👔 Bank Employee
    actor Manager as 💼 Bank Manager
    actor Admin as 🛠️ System Admin
    participant Frontend as 🌐 React 19 Frontend
    participant Backend as 🚀 FastAPI Backend
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL (privacy_app)
    participant K8s as ⚖️ K8s / HPA / Controller

    Note over Customer,Admin: 1. Authentication & Session Establishment
    Customer->>Frontend: Login (username + password)
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /auth/login
    Backend->>DB: Query user & verify Argon2id hash
    Backend-->>Frontend: Return HS256 JWT Token (Role: customer)

    Note over Customer,DB: 2. KYC Submission Creation
    Customer->>Frontend: Submit KYC Dossier (Ref, ID docs)
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /kyc/workflow/submissions (Bearer Token)
    Backend->>DB: Begin transaction; set_config('app.current_user_id', uid, true)
    Backend->>DB: INSERT into kyc_submissions (status='submitted')
    Backend->>DB: INSERT into kyc_versions (version=1, is_current=TRUE)
    Backend->>DB: INSERT into kyc_audit_log (event='submission_created')
    DB-->>Backend: Commit transaction
    Backend-->>Frontend: Return Submission Confirmation (KYCSubmissionResponse)

    Note over Backend,K8s: 3. Telemetry Scrape & Predictive Autoscaling
    Backend-->>K8s: Prometheus scrapes /metrics (submission rate increases)
    K8s->>K8s: Predictor evaluates persistence demand signal
    K8s->>K8s: Workload Controller patches backend-hpa minReplicas (Proactive Scale-Up)

    Note over Employee,DB: 4. Compliance Review & Delegation
    Employee->>Frontend: Access Compliance Workbench
    Frontend->>Backend: GET /kyc/workflow/employee/assigned
    Backend->>DB: Query assigned submissions (Scoped by app.current_user_id)
    DB-->>Backend: Return case dossier (Customer PII only; admin excluded)
    Employee->>Frontend: Record verification findings & risk recommendation
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /kyc/workflow/submissions/{id}/recommend
    Backend->>DB: INSERT kyc_reviews (action: recommend_approve/reject/request_correction)
    Backend->>DB: UPDATE kyc_submissions (status='pending_manager_decision')
    Backend->>DB: INSERT kyc_audit_log (event='review_completed')

    Note over Manager,DB: 5. Manager Oversight & Final Determination
    Manager->>Frontend: Open Management Console
    Frontend->>Backend: GET /kyc/workflow/manager/cases
    Manager->>Frontend: Select case & issue binding decision ('approve' / 'reject')
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /kyc/workflow/submissions/{id}/decision
    Backend->>DB: INSERT kyc_reviews (reviewer_role='bank_manager', action='approve'/'reject')
    Backend->>DB: UPDATE kyc_submissions (status='approved'/'rejected', closed_at=NOW())
    Backend->>DB: INSERT kyc_audit_log (event='case_approved'/'case_rejected')
    Note right of DB: Trigger verifies role='bank_manager' based on session app.current_user_id & checks matching review

    Note over Customer,Frontend: 6. Customer Receipt (Sanitized View)
    Customer->>Frontend: View 'My KYC' Status
    Frontend->>Backend: GET /kyc/workflow/submissions/{id}/decision
    Backend-->>Frontend: Return sanitized receipt (KYCDecisionResponse - internal notes omitted)

    Note over Admin,Backend: 7. Administrative Isolation Guard
    Admin->>Frontend: Access Admin Console
    Frontend->>Backend: Attempt GET /kyc/workflow/manager/cases
    Backend-->>Frontend: HTTP 403 Forbidden ("System administrators are not authorized to access customer KYC workflow content")
    Admin->>Frontend: View /monitoring/status & Prometheus telemetry (Permitted)
